refused: d101_plain_value_where_unit_is_asked.cy:9:39, line 9 column 39
 9 |     let $b: i32[unit: time.seconds] = $x;
   |                                       ^^
 what: this is `i32`, where `i32[unit: time.seconds]` is needed
